YOUR RECORD: {% if score_elimination_keeps is not defined or score_elimination_keeps %}{% if score_forfeit_keeps is defined and score_forfeit_keeps %}Running your lives out keeps {{ v.record_subject }} exactly as it stands, and so does forfeiting.{% else %}Running your lives out keeps {{ v.record_subject }} exactly as it stands. Forfeiting resets it to ZERO.{% endif %}{% else %}{% if score_forfeit_keeps is defined and score_forfeit_keeps %}Running your lives out resets {{ v.record_subject }} to ZERO. Forfeiting keeps it exactly as it stands.{% else %}Running your lives out resets {{ v.record_subject }} to ZERO, and so does forfeiting.{% endif %}{% endif %}{% endif %}
